###############################################
### 🚀 QUICK START GUIDE ###
###############################################
### 1. Run "Register Admin User" - Step 1
### 2. Run "Login with Admin" - Step 2
### 3. COPY the token from login response
### 4. Paste it here: @adminToken = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
### 5. Run all remaining requests in order
### 6. If 403 error → Check your token value
###############################################
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "m.user",
  "email": "m@marjane.ma",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "Mohamed",
  "lastName": "Nejjari",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eid": "A001",
  "password": "password123"
}

@@ Rest client will show token in response - COPY IT and replace @adminToken variable above

###############################################
### STEP 3: CREATE DEPARTMENTS (WITH TOKEN) ###
###############################################

### Create IT Department
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "departmentId": 1,
  "name": "Information Technology",
  "description": "IT Department - Hardware and Software Support"
}

